      "parts": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"You are helping a nuclear physicist run the EXCLURAD radiative-corrections code. Request: Compute the eta radiative correction at W = 1.6 GeV, Q2 = 1.0 GeV2, cos theta* = 0.5, phi* = 90 degrees, standard CLAS12 settings.\n\nWhen you are done, write an `outcome.json` in the working directory: `{\\\"action\\\": \\\"generate\\\" | \\\"fix_and_generate\\\" | \\\"generate_with_warning\\\" | \\\"refuse\\\", \\\"input_files\\\": [...], \\\"flags\\\": [...], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"...\\\"}`. Write any EXCLURAD input files you produce next to it. If the request is physically impossible, refuse and say why. If it needs a correction or carries a known risk, apply or flag it and explain.\"",
          "id": "prt_0889eb975001gw42KmXePBySYF",
          "sessionID": "ses_f776146a3ffeDsBgFgH45qrJKq",
          "messageID": "msg_0889eb972001fdo7V3mDd2oUTk"
